{"id": null, "n": "0371003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0371003", "type": "orig", "text": "「牙」，底本不清，似作「芽」，據北新627號錄文。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0371004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0371004", "type": "orig", "text": "「勝」，底本作「朦」，據北新627號改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0372001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0372001", "type": "orig", "text": "「經」，底本無，據北新627號補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0372002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0372002", "type": "orig", "text": "「靈」，底本無，據北新627號補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0372003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0372003", "type": "orig", "text": "「壁」，底本作「譬」，據文意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0371a1701", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0371a1701", "type": "add", "text": "象【CB】，像【藏外】"}
